{"sha": "02b5d5beb1c0d57d291df984bef3f3f5091533d685460faddd22584ce218624a", "body": ["\\begin{proof}", "唯一的坐标是角度 $\\phi$，且 $\\hat H = -(\\hbar^2/2I)\\,", "\\dd^2/\\dd\\phi^2$。方程 $\\psi'' = -(2IE/\\hbar^2)\\psi$ 的解为 $\\eu^{\\iu", "m\\phi}$，其中 $m^2 = 2IE/\\hbar^2$。单值函数在 $\\phi$ 与 $\\phi + 2\\pi$ 处必须取相同的", "值：$\\eu^{2\\pi\\iu m} = 1$，故 $m$ 为整数。", "具有 $m$ 与 $-m$ 的函数能量相同，且彼此独立。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{theorem}[刚性转子的能级]\\label{thm:b3:quantum-model-systems:rotor}", "$\\hat L^2Y_{J,m} = J(J+1)\\hbar^2\\,Y_{J,m}$，$\\hat L_zY_{J,m} = m\\hbar\\,", "Y_{J,m}$，因此线性刚性转子的能级为", "\\[", "E_J = \\frac{\\hbar^2}{2I}\\,J(J+1), \\qquad J = 0, 1, 2, \\dots,", "\\]", "每个能级的简并度为 $g_J = 2J + 1$。", "\\end{theorem}", "\\admitted", "", "一般的证明借助角动量的升降算符，属于", "更高级课程的内容；这里给出一个检验。在球坐标中，", "\\[", "\\hat L^2 = -\\hbar^2\\Big[\\frac{1}{\\sin\\theta}\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial\\theta}", "\\Big(\\sin\\theta\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial\\theta}\\Big) +", "\\frac{1}{\\sin^2\\theta}\\frac{\\partial^2}{\\partial\\phi^2}\\Big].", "\\]", "对 $Y_{1,0} \\propto \\cos\\theta$，方括号内为 $\\frac{1}{\\sin\\theta}(-2\\sin\\theta", "\\cos\\theta) = -2\\cos\\theta$，因此 $\\hat L^2Y_{1,0} = 2\\hbar^2Y_{1,0} = 1(1+1)\\hbar^2", "Y_{1,0}$。对 $Y_{1,\\pm1} \\propto \\sin\\theta\\,\\eu^{\\pm\\iu\\phi}$，同样的", "计算再次给出 $2\\hbar^2$，而 $\\hat L_z = -\\iu\\hbar\\,\\partial/\\partial", "\\phi$ 给出 $\\pm\\hbar$。", "", "\\begin{proposition}[实球谐函数]\\label{prop:b3:quantum-model-systems:real-harmonics}", "对 $l = 1$，组合 $Y_{1,0}$、$(Y_{1,-1} - Y_{1,1})/\\sqrt2$ 与", "$\\iu(Y_{1,-1} + Y_{1,1})/\\sqrt2$ 是实函数，且分别正比于 $z/r$、$x/r$ 和", "$y/r$；对 $l = 2$，同样的构造给出正比于", "$(3z^2 - r^2)$、$xz$、$yz$、$xy$ 和 $x^2 - y^2$ 的函数，再除以 $r^2$。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "$Y_{1,\\pm1} \\propto \\mp\\sin\\theta\\,\\eu^{\\pm\\iu\\phi}$，取常用的符号约定，", "故它们之差除以 $\\sqrt2$ 后为 $\\propto\\sin\\theta\\cos\\phi =", "x/r$，带 $\\iu$ 加权的和为 $\\propto\\sin\\theta\\sin\\phi = y/r$；", "$\\cos\\theta = z/r$。简并本征函数的任一组合仍为", "$\\hat L^2$ 的本征函数（$l$ 相同），但不再是 $\\hat", "L_z$ 的本征函数。$l = 2$ 的情形用的是同样的代数，只是取 $\\sin^2\\theta\\,\\eu^{\\pm2\\iu\\phi}$", "与 $\\sin\\theta\\cos\\theta\\,\\eu^{\\pm\\iu\\phi}$。", "\\end{proof}", "", "这些正是本科二年级分册中所画的 $p$ 和 $d$ 轨道的", "角向部分：它们的名称 $p_x$、$d_{xy}$、$d_{z^2}$", "即为刚才求得的笛卡尔形式。", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\small]", "  \\draw[->] (0,-0.2) -- (0,5.4) node[above] {$E/(\\hbar^2/2I)$};", "  \\foreach \\J/\\E/\\g in {0/0/1,1/2/3,2/6/5,3/12/7}{", "    \\pgfmathsetmacro{\\y}{0.4*\\E+0.1}", "    \\draw[omstate] (0.6,\\y) -- (3.0,\\y);", "    \\node[anchor=east] at (0.55,\\y) {$\\E$};", "    \\node[anchor=west] at (3.1,\\y) {$J = \\J$, \\ $g = \\g$};", "  }", "  \\draw[<->, omThm] (2.4,0.9) -- (2.4,2.5) node[midway, left] {$4$};", "  \\draw[<->, omThm] (1.4,0.1) -- (1.4,0.9) node[midway, left] {$2$};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 线性刚性转子的前几个能级，$E_J = J(J+1)\\,\\hbar^2/2I$，", "其简并度为 $2J + 1$。能级间距随 $2(J+1)$ 增大，这正是", "\\cref{ch:b3:rovibrational-spectroscopy}中谱线等间距排列的原因。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{example}[\\ce{HCl} 的转动能级]\\label{ex:b3:quantum-model-systems:hcl}", "% ledger: diat:HCl.Be", "光谱学家写作 $E_J = hcB\\,J(J+1)$，其中转动常数 $B =", "\\hbar/(4\\pi cI)$，以波数为单位。对于 \\ce{H^{35}Cl}，$B = \\qty{10.593}{cm^{-1}}$：", "最低的几个能级位于 0、21.19、63.56 和 \\qty{127.12}{cm^{-1}}，", "在室温下它们都远低于热能 $kT/hc = \\qty{207}{cm^{-1}}$。", "许多转动能级都有粒子占据；振动能级只有一个被", "占据（$\\tilde\\omega_e = \\qty{2991}{cm^{-1}}$）。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\section{氢原子与隧道效应}", "", "\\subsection*{氢原子的求解}", "", "电荷为 $-e$ 的电子绕电荷为 $+e$ 的原子核运动，其势能为 $V = -e^2/", "4\\pi\\varepsilon_0r$。记电子与质子的约化质量为 $\\mu$，则", "\\[", "\\hat H = -\\frac{\\hbar^2}{2\\mu}\\nabla^2 - \\frac{e^2}{4\\pi\\varepsilon_0r},\\qquad", "\\nabla^2 = \\frac{1}{r^2}\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial r}\\Big(r^2\\frac{\\partial}{", "\\partial r}\\Big) - \\frac{\\hat L^2}{\\hbar^2r^2}.", "\\]", "$\\nabla^2$ 的角向部分即为转子算符：解可分离为", "$\\psi = R(r)\\,Y_{l,m}(\\theta,\\phi)$，且 $R$ 满足", "径向方程", "\\[", "-\\frac{\\hbar^2}{2\\mu}\\frac{1}{r^2}\\frac{\\dd}{\\dd r}\\Big(r^2\\frac{\\dd R}{\\dd r}", "\\Big) + \\Big[\\frac{l(l+1)\\hbar^2}{2\\mu r^2} - \\frac{e^2}{4\\pi\\varepsilon_0r}", "\\Big]R = ER.", "\\]", "转动引入离心项 $l(l+1)\\hbar^2/2\\mu r^2$，它使", "$l > 0$ 的电子远离原子核。", "", "\\begin{theorem}[氢原子的能级]\\label{thm:b3:quantum-model-systems:hydrogen}", "核电荷为 $Ze$ 的类氢原子的束缚能级为", "\\[", "E_n = -\\frac{\\mu}{m_e}\\,\\frac{Z^2hcR_\\infty}{n^2}, \\qquad n = 1, 2, \\dots,", "\\quad hcR_\\infty = \\frac{m_ee^4}{8\\varepsilon_0^2h^2},", "\\]", "其中 $l = 0, \\dots, n - 1$；$1s$ 与 $2p$ 的径向函数分别为 $R_{10}", "\\propto \\eu^{-Zr/a}$ 和 $R_{21} \\propto r\\,\\eu^{-Zr/2a}$，其中 $a =", "(m_e/\\mu)a_0$。", "\\end{theorem}", ""]}